s/108860","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108860","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108860.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108860.patch","merged_at":"2025-07-22T16:27:17Z"},"body":"Fixes #108838.\r\nSupersedes #108839.\r\n\r\nThis introduces a reentrancy guard to `_err_print_error`, and another reentrancy guard to cover `__print_line`, `__print_line_rich` and `print_error`, which is meant to prevent cases where we (deliberately or not) emit an error from within a logger, or print from within a logger, thus causing infinite recursion.\r\n\r\nIn such cases we would now fall back on using `fprintf` instead.\r\n\r\nI also removed an already existing reentrancy guard in `CoreBind::OS::LoggerBind`, which I added as part of #91006 to achieve the same effect, albeit more localized.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108860/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https: